  FALSIFIERS
    F29 did not fire — no row clears its floor ⇒ no ordering ability at any separation
    F28 did not fire — curve spread 0.2848 (fires at or below 0.02)
    P-65 HELD — concordance rises with separation, each row within one sd of the row below
    P-66 ⛔ UNSCOREABLE — its subject is 'the top row', which is not defined without RATIO_EDGES.
         Committed edges: 0.8120 vs 0.70. Top edge of 2: 0.6775.
         ⇒ Withdrawn as a prediction about the model. P-69..P-72 replace it.
    P-67 FAILED — narrowest row 1.0–1.5x is ORDERS
    P-68 HELD — high is worse in 1 of 6 comparable rows (holds if <= 2)

    F32 did not fire — no target has a crossing that every seed reaches on a block of at least 30 pairs ⇒ no separation figure is quotable
    F33 did not fire — PAV pooled the whole curve into one block ⇒ the data cannot separate separations and no resolution exists
    P-69 ⛔ VOID — scored against a permutation null that measured sparsity, not skill. A model 90x worse passed it. The null is deleted; nothing replaces the verdict.
    P-70 HELD — 0.70 crossed at 8.61x (predicted 4x-16x)
    P-71 ⛔ VOID — same deleted null as P-69 (target 0.80).
    P-72 HELD — 0.60 crossed at 2.98x (predicted 2x-5x)

