  ⛔⛔ AND A CORRECTION TO THIS FILE'S OWN EARLIER CLAIM: it is NOT true that
     'no reported number depends on RATIO_EDGES'. The CROSSINGS do not. But F28's
     spread, F29, and the HELD/FAILED tokens for P-65, P-67 and P-68 are all read
     off the binned rows, so they move with the edges — and P-68's own criterion
     (at most 2 of 6) is a function of the ROW COUNT. ⇒ P-67 and P-68 have exactly
     the kind of edge-set subject that P-66 was retired for. They are NOT re-scored
     here; they are flagged, and a sweep is owed before either is cited again.
